OL,3,CSix arrested after man, 22, stabbed to
OL,4,Cdeath in Clapham
OL,6,FSix men have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder after a 22-year-
OL,8,Fold man was stabbed to death in
OL,9,FClapham.
OL,11,FThe Metropolitan Police believe the
OL,12,Fincident happened on Tremadoc Road,
OL,13,Foff Clapham High Street, at around
OL,14,F4:20 on Saturday 25 July.
OL,16,FThe victim died in hospital after
OL,17,Fbeing admitted with a stab wound.
OL,18,FPolice say his family have been
OL,19,Finformed and are being supported by
OL,20,Fofficers.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/5
