FL,374,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F373A1785070071
OL,3,CSix arrested after man, 22, stabbed to
OL,4,Cdeath in Clapham
OL,6,FShortly after the victim was admitted
OL,7,Fto hospital, four other men also
OL,8,Fattended with stab wounds.
OL,10,FThe four men, three aged 22 and one
OL,11,Faged 24, have since been arrested on
OL,12,Fsuspicion of murder.
OL,14,FTheir injuries are not considered to
OL,15,Fbe life-threatening or life-changing
OL,16,Fbut they remain in hospital for
OL,17,Ftreatment.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/5
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
