OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,374,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F373A1785070071
OL,3,CSix arrested after man, 22, stabbed to
OL,4,Cdeath in Clapham
OL,6,FOfficers also arrested a 27-year-old
OL,7,Fman and 23-year-old man at the
OL,8,Fhospital on suspicion of murder. They
OL,9,Fremain in police custody.
OL,11,FDetective Chief Inspector Sarah Lee,
OL,12,Fwho is leading the investigation said:
OL,13,F"Our enquiries are progressing
OL,14,Fquickly, and we understand that the
OL,15,Fvictim was stabbed at around 04:20 hrs
OL,16,Fclose to Tremadoc Road in Clapham.
OL,18,F"Those in the area will continue to
OL,19,Fnotice an increased police presence
OL,20,Fthroughout the day as these enquiries
OL,21,Fcontinue.
OL,26,@uD@AOUzD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/5
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,374,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F373A1785070071
OL,3,CSix arrested after man, 22, stabbed to
OL,4,Cdeath in Clapham
OL,6,F"Officers have arrested six men on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder and we are working
OL,8,Fquickly to establish what has
OL,9,Fhappened."
OL,11,FSuperintendent Mark Gallacher, a
OL,12,Fpolicing lead for the area said: "This
OL,13,Fis a tragic incident and our officers
OL,14,Fcontinue to support the family of the
OL,15,Fyoung man who has sadly died.
OL,17,F"We understand that this will cause
OL,18,Fconcern among the local community and
OL,19,Fspecialist detectives are doing
OL,20,Feverything possible to determine what
OL,21,Fhas happened.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@JO]tD@bOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/5
