PN,37305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F373A1785070071
OL,3,CSix arrested after man, 22, stabbed to
OL,4,Cdeath in Clapham
OL,6,F"We are asking anyone with any
OL,7,Finformation or anyone who may have
OL,8,Fwitnessed anything in the early hours
OL,9,Fto contact us and support with the
OL,10,Fongoing investigation."
OL,12,FAnyone who witnessed the incident or
OL,13,Fhas information is urged to contact
OL,14,Fpolice on 101, quoting reference 1474/
OL,15,F25July. Information can also be shared
OL,16,Fanonymously with Crimestoppers on 0800
OL,17,F555 111.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@WO]
